      "message": "Can you please mention which controller is causing issues like this ?\nBoth HCI LE Read Local Supported Features and HCI LE Read Supported States are mandatory if the controller supports LE.\n\nRather than add a bandaid here, I think a preferred alternative would be to emulate the commands in the IBluetoothHci HAL.",
